WEBVTT

00:10:27.748 --> 00:10:31.043
Southgate penned
an open letter to the nation,

00:10:31.043 --> 00:10:32.294
saying,

00:10:32.336 --> 00:10:35.923
"I have a responsibility
to the wider community

00:10:35.923 --> 00:10:38.801
to use my voice, and so do the players.

00:10:39.176 --> 00:10:43.097
It's their duty to continue
to interact with the public

00:10:43.138 --> 00:10:48.394
on matters such as equality,
inclusivity and racial injustice,

00:10:48.435 --> 00:10:53.524
while using the power of their voices
to help put debates on the table,

00:10:53.524 --> 00:10:56.068
raise awareness and educate."

00:10:56.527 --> 00:10:59.780
There would soon be
another moment of truth.